(7295130, 1137060, 153814, '<td valign="top">Great shot, you can''t go wrong with fireworks.</td>', 'Great shot, you can''t go wrong with fireworks.', '2014-12-23 10:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295178, 1137275, 13077, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge. And an interesting shape of the shadow and light, it looks almost like an eye.</td>', 'Meets the challenge. And an interesting shape of the shadow and light, it looks almost like an eye.', '2014-12-23 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295182, 1137332, 13077, '<td valign="top">A cool idea, and nicely done hiding the power cord to the lights.</td>', 'A cool idea, and nicely done hiding the power cord to the lights.', '2014-12-23 13:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295183, 1137246, 13077, '<td valign="top">A  nice candid and good use of the sunglases, but I don''t feel like the light source is the subject at all.</td>', 'A  nice candid and good use of the sunglases, but I don''t feel like the light source is the subject at all.', '2014-12-23 13:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295184, 1137285, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2014-12-23 13:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295185, 1137320, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks cool. A good angle to shoot from and the sepia tones give it a nice look</td>', 'Looks cool. A good angle to shoot from and the sepia tones give it a nice look', '2014-12-23 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295187, 1137293, 13077, '<td valign="top">A very pretty display, and the clouds and cars going by are a nice touch.</td>', 'A very pretty display, and the clouds and cars going by are a nice touch.', '2014-12-23 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295188, 1137098, 13077, '<td valign="top">Has an interesting look to it. I like the soft foreground (must have been a pretty long lens to go with a small enough aperture to get the starbursts and still have that shallow DOF). Not sure if this position you shot it from was quite the best for the scene, though.</td>', 'Has an interesting look to it. I like the soft foreground (must have been a pretty long lens to go with a small enough aperture to get the starbursts and still have that shallow DOF). Not sure if this position you shot it from was quite the best for the scene, though.', '2014-12-23 13:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295189, 1137052, 13077, '<td valign="top">Skillfully done lights, but I don''t like the composition (more specifically, how the zebras ear clashes with the lit-up tree behind it)</td>', 'Skillfully done lights, but I don''t like the composition (more specifically, how the zebras ear clashes with the lit-up tree behind it)', '2014-12-23 13:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295190, 1137276, 13077, '<td valign="top">Deer''s-eye-view!</td>', 'Deer''s-eye-view!', '2014-12-23 13:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295192, 1137329, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and the bokeh circles are interesting.</td>', 'Very pretty, and the bokeh circles are interesting.', '2014-12-23 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295193, 1137308, 13077, '<td valign="top">That thing sure makes cool shadows.</td>', 'That thing sure makes cool shadows.', '2014-12-23 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295194, 1137291, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good sharp detail in the leaves and a nice range of colors. I like the (mostly) filled frame compostion, but the ornament saying "merry Christmas" at the top is chopped off a bit.</td>', 'Good sharp detail in the leaves and a nice range of colors. I like the (mostly) filled frame compostion, but the ornament saying "merry Christmas" at the top is chopped off a bit.', '2014-12-23 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295198, 1137321, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks cold, but nice. I miss having little iced-over creeks to walk on in the winter.<br/>Photo wise, I think the composition works well, framed between the trees on both sides. I do think the light sources are the subject, but maybe not overtly so.</td>', 'Looks cold, but nice. I miss having little iced-over creeks to walk on in the winter.Photo wise, I think the composition works well, framed between the trees on both sides. I do think the light sources are the subject, but maybe not overtly so.', '2014-12-23 13:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295199, 1137274, 13077, '<td valign="top">Hope that wasn''t a drunk driver...<br/>Not crazy about the composition or the lack of focus in this one.</td>', 'Hope that wasn''t a drunk driver...Not crazy about the composition or the lack of focus in this one.', '2014-12-23 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295200, 1137296, 13077, '<td valign="top">Portrayed well. Also exactly why I try to avoid shopping this time of year.</td>', 'Portrayed well. Also exactly why I try to avoid shopping this time of year.', '2014-12-23 13:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295201, 1137126, 13077, '<td valign="top">Tonic water under a blacklight?<br/>I tried to pull that off but yours worked a lot better than mine. Nicely done. Could maybe do with more definition on the stem of the glass though, I''m assuming it was a long exposure so some light painting would work well.</td>', 'Tonic water under a blacklight?I tried to pull that off but yours worked a lot better than mine. Nicely done. Could maybe do with more definition on the stem of the glass though, I''m assuming it was a long exposure so some light painting would work well.', '2014-12-23 13:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295202, 1137133, 13077, '<td valign="top">Simple but attractive, exposed and composed well.</td>', 'Simple but attractive, exposed and composed well.', '2014-12-23 13:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295203, 1137286, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool toy. The blue light coming from below on the boy gives it a spooky or alien vibe overall, nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like a cool toy. The blue light coming from below on the boy gives it a spooky or alien vibe overall, nicely done.', '2014-12-23 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295204, 1137297, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks sharp and well exposed, but with all that negative space I think it would have worked better to have two of the lights at opposite angles with the tips near one another.</td>', 'Looks sharp and well exposed, but with all that negative space I think it would have worked better to have two of the lights at opposite angles with the tips near one another.', '2014-12-23 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295205, 1137060, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fortunately timed firework display for you, eh?<br/>Well exposed and the foreground adds some interesting angles and textures to it.</td>', 'Fortunately timed firework display for you, eh?Well exposed and the foreground adds some interesting angles and textures to it.', '2014-12-23 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295206, 1137318, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, but not crazy about the swirly texture in this case.</td>', 'Cool photo, but not crazy about the swirly texture in this case.', '2014-12-23 13:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295207, 1137030, 13077, '<td valign="top">A very shapely lamp. Well placed and good exposure, too.</td>', 'A very shapely lamp. Well placed and good exposure, too.', '2014-12-23 13:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295210, 1137307, 150277, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge, I like the clarity of the ropes.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge, I like the clarity of the ropes.', '2014-12-23 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295212, 1137318, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the feathery smoke like strands around the pyramid.  (Although I thought the feathery strands on top of the pyramid were a bit odd.) But I thought this was a perfect entry for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the feathery smoke like strands around the pyramid.  (Although I thought the feathery strands on top of the pyramid were a bit odd.) But I thought this was a perfect entry for the challenge.', '2014-12-23 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295213, 1137293, 150277, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  Beautiful lights, the light was definitely the star of the image making it perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  Beautiful lights, the light was definitely the star of the image making it perfect for the challenge.', '2014-12-23 14:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295214, 1137334, 150277, '<td valign="top">Cute, perfect for the challenge.  I thought your composition was very pleasing.</td>', 'Cute, perfect for the challenge.  I thought your composition was very pleasing.', '2014-12-23 14:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295215, 1137300, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge.  Well executed!</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge.  Well executed!', '2014-12-23 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295216, 1137282, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the soft color and light in the image.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I like the soft color and light in the image.  Beautiful.', '2014-12-23 14:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295217, 1137026, 150277, '<td valign="top">I think this was a great entry for the challenge.  I love the capture of both yellow and blue of the flame.  I liked how you filled the frame as well.</td>', 'I think this was a great entry for the challenge.  I love the capture of both yellow and blue of the flame.  I liked how you filled the frame as well.', '2014-12-23 14:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295218, 1137332, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the juxtaposition of the white lights in the jar with the blue light outside of the jar.  I cannot image how you accomplished this, seems magical to me.</td>', 'I love the juxtaposition of the white lights in the jar with the blue light outside of the jar.  I cannot image how you accomplished this, seems magical to me.', '2014-12-23 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295219, 1137329, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and softness in this image.  The light is definitely the start of your shot.</td>', 'I love the colors and softness in this image.  The light is definitely the start of your shot.', '2014-12-23 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7295220, 1137294, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like that the light is definitely highlighted in your image.  I also like the sharp contrast between your light subject and the black of the background.  The imperfections in the surface of the object, the brown ''spots'', distracted me a bit and kept me from loving the color.</td>', 'I like that the light is definitely highlighted in your image.  I also like the sharp contrast between your light subject and the black of the background.  The imperfections in the surface of the object, the brown ''spots'', distracted me a bit and kept me from loving the color.', '2014-12-23 14:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
