(7295473, 1137274, 37719, '<td valign="top">For a first entry on this site - well done!  I can see the creative thought in your composition.  Do not let the voting or placement in challenges get you down here.  Be true to yourself and enter what you feel is right. This is a very competitive and skilled site. Read the forums, shoot to please you and only you...just my opinion.  But stay with us...you will learn a lot.  There are people here to cover the whole spectrum - absolute professional to absolute amateur and we all get along.<br/> <br/>Okay, that said, what is your primary light source?  What is the green ''artifact'' light?  What is the pulsing light in the sky in the background?</td>', 'For a first entry on this site - well done!  I can see the creative thought in your composition.  Do not let the voting or placement in challenges get you down here.  Be true to yourself and enter what you feel is right. This is a very competitive and skilled site. Read the forums, shoot to please you and only you...just my opinion.  But stay with us...you will learn a lot.  There are people here to cover the whole spectrum - absolute professional to absolute amateur and we all get along. Okay, that said, what is your primary light source?  What is the green ''artifact'' light?  What is the pulsing light in the sky in the background?', '2014-12-24 20:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
